ession, then client.&#10;ChatAgentBase checks the returned content. A&#10;  forbidden reply becomes a fixed explanation and&#10;  counts as a valid reply, so Copilot mode&#10;  remains active.&#10;SDK errors become ChatAgentException; missing or&#10;  blank content is rejected." style="shape=note;size=16;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffbe8;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="690" width="390" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="state-note" value="A new scoped session starts with offlineMode = false.&#10;Caller cancellation propagates without changing mode.&#10;Timeout applies to startup, send, and cleanup; late provider&#10;  results are discarded." style="shape=note;size=16;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fffbe8;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="710" width="500" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="07-test-helper-classes" name="7. Testing infrastructure class diagram"><mxGraphModel dx="2600" dy="2770" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2600" pageHeight="2770" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="7. Testing infrastructure class diagram" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=27;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="2520" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Concrete shared helpers, nested test doubles and their production / framework contracts. Nested names include the containing class." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fon